      "description": "<ul>\n<li>add CustomLocales RU/EN translate</li>\n<li>add test chatbot (not functional)</li>\n<li>add CustomQuests</li>\n<li>add 8 Miyuki Story Quest</li>\n<li>add Quests img</li>\n<li>remove insurance (not work, mb later)</li>\n<li>loyaltyLevels adapted for quests</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1>what will happen in 2.0.2?</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>translation into Russian and English all quest</li>\n<li>add +8 quest (first chapter will end)</li>\n<li>add CustomQuestsZone</li>\n<li>add new props</li>\n<li>add Quests img</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><code>I'm currently busy writing new quests based on Miyuki's story, but I'm also looking forward to hearing your suggestions for adding new items in the comments.</code></p>\n<p><code>Unfortunately, I don't have much time due to my work, and I've completed 8 out of the 15 quests in the first chapter. Additionally, there is no English translation available, but I will include it in version 2.0.2</code></p>\n",
